OL,3,GNEWSABlind man sentenced for 150-mile
OL,4,Adrive while drunk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blind motorist who took his partner's
OL,7,Fcar and drove for 150 miles (240km) at
OL,8,Fnight while drunk has been handed a
OL,9,Fsuspended sentence.
OL,11,FAnthony Hall, 50, who does not have a
OL,12,Fdriving licence, was stopped by police
OL,13,Fon the M6 near Carlisle at 01:45 BST on
OL,14,F29 June after he was seen swerving the
OL,15,FVauxhall Meriva between lanes and onto
OL,16,Fthe hard shoulder, a court was told.
OL,18,FHall told police he had driven from his
OL,19,Fhome in Huddersfield after he and his
OL,20,Fpartner had drunk four bottles of wine.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
