OL,3,GNEWSABlind man sentenced for 150-mile
OL,4,Adrive while drunk
OL,5,
OL,6,FKirklees Magistrates' Court heard Hall,
OL,7,Fof Lees Close, had admitted charges
OL,8,Fincluding dangerous driving at a
OL,9,Fprevious hearing and was sentenced on
OL,10,FTuesday to 36 weeks in prison,
OL,11,Fsuspended for 18 months.
